<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts Intel rating.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts Intel rating.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette cut its rating on Intel Corp to market perform from outperform, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The source said the downgrade was tied to the sharp rise in Intel's share price in recent days.</p>
<p>-- The DLJ analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Intel's stock was trading at 111-5/8 on Tuesday morning, up four points from Monday's close.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
